{"id":"vod_bf_140409","vodId":"140409","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"黄泉的使者","name_cn":"黄泉的使者","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260405-1/a9175b8c7c3ef1b19a34f76b68d27bb4.webp"},"summary":"月落和亚晨是一对双胞胎兄妹，他们在一个与世隔绝的深山小村落里出生，被称为“分隔夜与昼的双子”。他们拥有获得特殊力量的资格，一场围绕他们的双使战斗也随之展开。 双使是一种成对的存在，被人类冠以“幽灵”、“怪物”、“怪兽”或“异形”等各种各样的称呼。它们并非人人可见，各自拥有不同的外表、性格和能力。每对双使都有一个与之缔结契约的主子，而指挥它们的主子被称为“双使师”。 许多大人在双胞兄妹开始懂事前就暗中操纵，试图夺取他们的力量，因此月落和亚晨在年幼时就被迫分离。本作故事以兄妹俩的重逢展开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-21 11:00:06","episodeCount":24,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/e6ea1ff802bf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/d4036da12d25/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/1be56e072d73/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/934b96b2b03c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/c86a8e2bd2ff/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/c53912c7b95f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/f18f76d7eab0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/a0de58c63167/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/50f2b7288e0b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/7c716f0e18fe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/e3ad6256f5d2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/8a457bd8ae68/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/huangquandeshizhe/74ac6d4583ba/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/vide